    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1725ed16fbe787ebd0af7b69",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一路上有过荣耀。也曾遭遇挫折。\n但目白家的赛马娘仍然不会停下脚步，\n她们受到时代之风吹拂……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f637e0c3ca720d3123e98506295e371cdd55000b1569bf80db7907dab5d9e0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
