      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白家之所以能持续到现在，正是因为目白家成员\n一直走在对自己来说最正确的方向上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d47f91f363425365ac2f4485a11088a3e7ad31d39a77ffd47e9b046aa491e7b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19c8bfa79cfd5643873fcf0f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cce4d859896c50ae77983029951d94a41ba9369dc531a5184d37f6b802e9b98",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
