      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而目白家之所以能继续前进，正是因为\n纵然我们因应时代有所变化，\n今天仍能成功展现应有的姿态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43e0328a63afdf36e1d48ad8847936a0e2a3a82f7b7b5db1b09379f0003f073b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
