      "uid": "zhcn:67b0a037e381850b77d83e36",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以家族传统为荣……难道真的\n光靠着这一点就能发挥出如此斗志吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "92632aacbd241541cf11f467a4e19fce3fe8ac77216ec780e8c5e57c8f03dafe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
