      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就是啊……远远早在我们出生前\n目白家就已经存在。\n她们的历史比谁都悠久……",
      "source_fingerprint": "af4b400f4a8a18a72639f51ecad260fc286bd4f55901abce2c6580189bb524d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
