    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e4f4f99db03c424623ca1e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是个能由憧憬孕育憧憬的家族。\n她们的光辉绝不会有浅薄得\n轻易被时代浪潮吞没的一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ad989d462ee992b19e7169de936249f61df38799c2bae577611e891655ebd9d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
