      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在场的赛马娘们眼中自然地浮现敬意与赞赏。\n名门依旧闪耀着无法动摇的光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4db08dd4f704b0e5d3c5ebb4fdcb1cf55881e604799d40b2d284d54cb575be05",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
