      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49bb8e6bd4e51272a08795c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我非常清～楚你们每一位的过人之处呢。\n就连站在所有人前方的现在，\n我也还是没有忘记。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a167fc12e4d0923fcd09c4d34ac4e8e98b63119c96961f5b35a81ed7a78b1267",
